Test: mindmap-no-duplicate-decoration >> invalid >>> docs/rules/mindmap-no-duplicate-decoration.md incorrect 1
Filename: mindmap-no-duplicate-decoration-incorrect-1.mmd

Code:
  1 | mindmap
  2 |   Plans
  3 |     Write
  4 |     :::urgent
  5 |     :::large
    |     ^~~~~~~~ [1]
  6 |

[1] mermaid.js keeps only the last class line and drops the earlier ones for this node.
